  "cleanText": "Solution home \n\t\tGeneral\n\t\tQuick Guides: Getting Started with Capium\n\n### Submission Credentials for Accounts and Corporation Tax filing\n\n\t\t\tPrint\n\n\tModified on: Thu, 11 Jul, 2024 at  7:50 AM\n\n\t\tSee below the credentials required for accounts and corporation tax filing:\n\nYour companies House Presenter ID - The Presenter Identifier starts with 000 and ends with 000, is a mixture of numbers and letters and is 11 characters long. This is usually entered in capitals.\n\nYou Company authentication code - 6 digit\n\nYou Company's Government gateway credentials -  Can be up to 12 characters\n\nMore information can be found here: https://capium.freshdesk.com/a/solutions/articles/9000236664\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tDid you find it helpful?\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tYes\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tNo\n\nSend feedback\tSorry we couldn't be helpful. Help us improve this article with your feedback.",
